/**
 * /contribute — Editorial contributor guidelines for Maine Dispensary Guide
 *
 * Subtle inbound guest-post landing page. NOT linked from main nav. Discoverable
 * via:
 *   - /for-journalists ("Want to contribute? See our contributor guidelines")
 *   - footer "Stay Connected" (small text link)
 *   - robots.txt allow + sitemap entry (SEO-discoverable for journalists/researchers
 *     searching "maine cannabis write for us" or "maine dispensary guide guest post")
