<Callout title="Who we're looking for" type="passion">
  Maine-licensed operators (cultivators, manufacturers, retailers), CPAs and attorneys with cannabis practices, OCP compliance consultants, real estate brokers who've worked the Maine cannabis market, agricultural researchers with a Maine focus, and independent policy analysts. Bylined submissions only — we do not run anonymous or sponsored content.
</Callout>

