    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">A clear pitch is enough. Please do not send a full draft until we have confirmed that the topic is a fit.</p>
  </div>

  <Callout title="Before you pitch" type="info">
    Read <a href="/for-journalists">/for-journalists</a> for our research data, citation formats, and the kind of primary-source material we can supply to support your piece. If your piece depends on data we have, mention that in your pitch — we can usually pre-stage the numbers.
  </Callout>
